    desc => 'ci( changes text inside parentheses',
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Macro: `xt/visual/macros/text_object_ci_paren`

Tests the `ci(` text object which deletes text inside parentheses,
enters insert mode, then we type replacement text.

**initial.png** — Cursor on 'h' inside the parentheses at line 1 col 5.

Keys: `ci(` then type `x, y` then `<Escape>`

**after_ci_paren.png** — Content between parentheses changed to `x, y`.
